        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A type of expression pattern evidence that is based on the expression pattern of a reporter gene.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>eco</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
