            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A type of bait-prey hybrid interaction evidence that is based on a protein-DNA complementation assay where a single promoter acts as bait and is screened against a library of prey transcription factors.</obo:IAO_0000115>
