        <obo:IAO_0000115>A type of nucleic acid binding evidence in which DNA-protein binding is detected using labeled DNA as probes, hybridized to electrophoretically separated proteins.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>eco</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
