        <obo:IAO_0000115>A type of transport assay evidence in which the uptake mechanism of a transporter is investigated in a cell that does not normally express that protein.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>eco</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>uptake assay in heterologous system</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
