        <obo:IAO_0000115>A type of chromosome conformation-based evidence that is derived by inverse polymerase chain reaction (inverse PCR) on a circularized 3C library prior to product quantitation with multiplexed high-throughput (HT) sequencing.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:created_by>mchibucos</oboInOwl:created_by>
        <oboInOwl:creation_date>2010-11-30T03:22:25Z</oboInOwl:creation_date>
