        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>mechanical constraint evidence</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:id>ECO:0000241</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Many environmental factors are subject to modification, such as temperature, pressure, humidity, radiation, and so forth.</rdfs:comment>
