        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A type of experimental evidence in which a plasmid that is capable of being replicated is introduced into cells, cells are grown without selection for several generations, and retention of the plasmid is determined.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:created_by>mchibucos</oboInOwl:created_by>
        <oboInOwl:creation_date>2012-08-24T01:27:58Z</oboInOwl:creation_date>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>minichromosome maintenance assay evidence</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>eco</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ECO:0000340</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Loss per generation is determined by comparing colony numbers on selective and non-selective media.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>plasmid maintenance assay evidence</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
