        <oboInOwl:id>ECO:0001056</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>This term was made obsolete for a couple of reasons: the def. doesn’t make sense as the suggested means of mutagenesis fail to introduce exogenous DNA (it is a child of genetic transformation evidence) and the def. is too much like random mutagenesis evidence.</rdfs:comment>
