        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECO_0000109"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>The real-time RT-PCR validated that Zur repressed the first gene of each of the three operons, znuA, znuCB and ykgM-rpmJ2 (Additional file 5).</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A type of reverse transcription polymerase chain reaction evidence that combines reverse transcription polymerase chain reaction and real time polymerase chain reaction to quantitatively assay for the detection of RNA levels.</obo:IAO_0000115>
