        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>eco</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ECO:0001813</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Chemical shifts in the spectrum indicating binding can be detected from analysis of a protein spectrum in the presence or absence of its cognate DNA binding site.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>heteronuclear single quantum coherence spectroscopy evidence</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
