        <obo:IAO_0000115>A type of reporter gene assay evidence used to locate and isolate Fur sites where a plasmid library is created and cloned into a cell line with a ferric uptake regulator (Fur)-repressed reporter and the Fur protein is titrated away from its binding site on the reporter, after which the cell is isolated and plasmid extracted for further sequence analysis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
