        <obo:IAO_0000115>A type of protein detection assay evidence where soft ionization is used for the analysis of biomolecules for mass determination in a three step process of plate preparation, radiation, and ionization with high throughput technology.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000234>CollecTF</obo:IAO_0000234>
        <oboInOwl:created_by>snadendla</oboInOwl:created_by>
