        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>MALDI-TOF-MS</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>eco</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ECO:0005526</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>MALDI-TOF MS is commonly used for protein identification in constructing a proteome where protein fingerprints obtained by microbial cells are compared with a database of reference spectra by means of various algorithms integrated in systems recently made commercially available.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>matrix-assisted laser desorption/ionization time-of-flight mass spectrometry evidence</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
