    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECO_0005611">
        <obo:IAO_0000115>OBSOLETE. A type of direct assay evidence used in manual assertion where phenotype or disease association is made with the gene because of involvement in the molecular mechanism of disease or involvement in a pathway known to contribute to a disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
