        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECO_0007061"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A type of light scattering evidence derived from determining the properties of particles in a solution such as size, shape, structure, molecular weight and structural transitions by irradiating the sample with an X-ray beam and the scattered intensity is probed at small angles (typically in the range of 0.1-10 degrees) by a detector.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000234>DisProt:BalintMeszaros</obo:IAO_0000234>
        <oboInOwl:created_by>snadendla</oboInOwl:created_by>
