        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">An immunoprecipitation in which chromatin (i.e. packaged DNA which can include protein and RNA complexes) is cut into short regions, reversibly cross linked, and antibodies or tags are used to select for pieces of chromatin with desired characteristics.</obo:IAO_0000115>
