        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cell proliferation assay in which cells are cultured in the presence of BrdU which is incorporated into newly synthesized DNA of replicating cells (during the S phase of the cell cycle), substituting for thymidine during DNA replication, which can be quantified by BrdU specific antibodies.</obo:IAO_0000115>
