            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cell proliferation assay in which cells are cultured in the presence of tritiated thymidine which is incorporated into newly synthesized DNA of replicating cells (during the S phase of the cell cycle). The radioactivity of tritiated thymidine in a cell is a proxy for cells that were actively replicating.</obo:IAO_0000115>
