        <obo:IAO_0000115>A liquid chromatography instrument that consists of a reservoir of mobile phase, a pump, an injector, a separation column, and a detector. The pump (rather than gravity) provides the higher pressure required to propel the mobile phase and analyte through the densely packed column.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>high performance liquid chromatography instrument</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


