        <obo:IAO_0000115>A microscope that is used to increase micrograph contrast and/or reconstruct three-dimensional images by using a spatial pinhole to eliminate out-of-focus light in specimens that are thicker than the focal plane.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>confocal microscope</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


