        <obo:IAO_0000115>An analyte assay that uses a biomaterial&apos;s preferential affinity for either the mobile phase or the stationary phase to separate it from other materials and thereby detect its presence in an input material.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>analytical chromatography</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


