        <obo:IAO_0000115>An imaging assay in which an electrons are used to probe the density, shape and composition of an input material which are detected in an electron microscope and utilized to produce an image of the material.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>electron microscopy imaging assay</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


