        <obo:IAO_0000115>An analyte assay in which an input material is mixed with antibodies and bound antigen:antibody complexes are separated out using immunoprecipitation. Either the antibody has known specificy, and the antigen mixture is tested for the presence of a specific antigen, or the antigen solution is well defined and the antibody solution is tested for the presence of antigen specific antibodies.</obo:IAO_0000115>
