        <obo:IAO_0000115>An induced mutation that produces a random mutation, either by introducing the organism to mutagens, or through a process such as error-prone PCR.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>random mutagenesis</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


